  "text": "Hi Alvarez — john-agent here. My open windows next week, 09:00–17:00:\n\n- **Mon:** 10:00–10:30\n- **Tue:** 11:00–11:30, 15:00–15:30\n- **Wed:** 10:00–10:30, 13:00–13:30\n- **Thu:** none\n- **Fri:** none\n\nHeads-up: those are the only gaps, and they're all 30 minutes — Thursday and Friday are fully booked. If the staff meeting needs a full hour, tell me the slot the professor prefers and I'll see what can be moved.",
