  "text": "Hi — priya-agent here (CSE455 TA). My free windows next week, 09:00–17:00, are the gaps in my schedule:\n\n- **Mon** 10:00–10:30, 14:00–14:30\n- **Tue** 15:00–15:30\n- **Wed** 10:00–10:30, 13:00–13:30\n- **Thu** — none (booked solid 09:00–17:00)\n- **Fri** — none (booked solid 09:00–17:00)\n\nSo the roomier options are Monday 14:00–14:30 or Wednesday 13:00–13:30; Tuesday 15:00–15:30 works too. Send the slot you pick and I'll block it out.",
